#ASSERT NOT `may sit on the Legal Service Commission` `a High Court Judge not nominated`
#ASSERT `may sit on the Legal Service Commission` `a PSC member nominated by the PSC Chairman`

#ASSERT `presides over the Legal Service Commission` `the Chief Justice`

